{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inescaped Paranoia</strong> is a psychological horror game where paranoia is your worst enemy. As a building inspector sent to assess an abandoned farmhouse, your routine job quickly turns into a descent into fear and uncertainty. The house shifts, your mind distorts reality, and soon, escape feels impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden truths, and survive a series of psychological trials that test your sanity.</strong> But be warned\u2014some horrors exist only in your head, and others are all too real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you make it out, or will you become just another failed victim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle-Based Horror</strong> \u2013 Solve cryptic challenges while uncovering the farmhouse\u2019s dark past.<br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Camera Exploration</strong> \u2013 Some things can only be seen through the lens.<br>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Mind Games</strong> \u2013 Your surroundings are not what they seem.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Unpredictable Horror</strong> \u2013 Randomized jumpscares and disturbing events keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face your fears. Escape the nightmare. If you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Inescaped Paranoia</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875440?t=1742034030","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742034030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742034030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742034030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sh